<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Dũya Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">2 Ukorinti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ubvur uwu uvaa Uburhu aka atsɛnge abi Ukorinti</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Ukorinti</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Uko</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ubvur uwu uvaa Uburhu aka atsɛnge abi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ukorinti</para>
  <para style="imt">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur Ukorinti uwu uvaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Uburhu uner itser Uyesu aka amaa itsɛnge abi Ukorinti ubvur uwu inggbaashia, asi idãrhũnga na atsɛng ubvur uwu uvaa. Anu ikaifɛrhkɔ agɛ Uburhu atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ ri ivangyɛ unga aka awe ru Umakidoniya, ra anangkɛ unga aka atɔ̃ itser idzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize. Atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ ra amɛk aki 55 udzur ru unumkpi umbɔ aka amar Uyesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ubvur uwurɛ udɛyiwe abika adɔsa ru Ukorinti ugɛ icicang ishingge Uburhu ana abemunga umbɔ, ikɛi udɛyiwe umbɔ ugɛ umbɔ agbishu isiseimbɔ nggu Unum ru ubok Uyesu. Akɛrɛ aka amaa, Uburhu ashɔ̃rhã umbɔ ugɛ umbɔ ama akɔng uhwɛk ukpuku uyike abika adɔsa ru Urusharhima, ubinkutsu unga asi ídãrhũnga na aba ru umbɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Anyãmbɔ ugɛ awe ru ubvur uwurɛ Uburhu aka arherha arherhe ri itsinga ananga abvurnga akɔɔ. Akɛrɛ awe rimi ubinkutsu ri ivangyɛ Uburhu aka atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ idamɛn iwengge akarhãrhã ri itsinga nggu abika adɔsa abɔɔ ru Ukorinti.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ru ubvur ha, Uburhu akaa itsinga ru urhenakpi abi imesi igbɛrangwĩ aka agɔr ugɛ unga asi iwea uner itser Uyesu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abinkɛ aka awe umɔ</para>
  <para style="io1">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur ha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2CO 1:1-11">1.1-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Uburhu nggu abika adɔsa ru Ukorinti <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2CO 1:12-7:16">1.12—7.16</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Idzidzowe ra abika adɔsa ru ugbɛr uwu Uyahuda <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2CO 8:1-9:15">8.1—9.15</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Uburhu akaa itsinga <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2CO 10:1-13:10">10.1—13.10</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Arherhe aki imaatak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2CO 13:11-14">13.11-14</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1"/>Umum iwu Uburhu. Unum aka asɛng umum iwe uner itser Uyesu Ukiristo. Umum iwe nggimi nggu ungwɛ̃mɛn Utimoti. Umum itsɛnge ikikɔng abika adɔsa ru Ukorinti nu kishoo abika adɔsa ra abĩ Uakaya.<verse eid="2CO 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2"/>Unum Utɛmɛn nu Uteijee Uyesu Ukiristo ama adzaa umbi idorh nu ididɔɔr.<verse eid="2CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikpikpoi ru Unum uwu kishoo ififita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3"/>Ikpikpoi iwe ru Unum nu Utɛ uwu Uteijeemɛn Uyesu Ukiristo! Unga awu Utɛ icicorhe nu Unum uwuku ufituwa umɛn ubɛn ivang. <verse eid="2CO 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4"/>Unga afituwa umɛn ra ayetnummɛn kishoo, ngge itsú umɛn iwuri ifituwe abɔɔ nggu ififitayɛ umɛn iki iyɛi ru Unum. <verse eid="2CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5"/>Ru nyaka ayetnum Ukiristo aka atsĩ ru ibibɛkmɛn akarhãrhã, ikɛi awu ru ubok Ukiristo umɛn iki ikpo ififita ha akarhãrhã. <verse eid="2CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6"/>Umɛn ĩba iwu ra ayetnum, awu ififita nu ififɔrhmbi. Umɛn ĩba ikpo ififita, iwe ru ififitambi, iki ighwɛr ru umbi idɔngamɛn ibibima ra ayetnum hã umɛn iki ihwa. <verse eid="2CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7"/>Ifosamɛn ru umbi idɛ̃ɛ̃ iker, ubinkutsu umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ ru nyaka umbi aka ahwa ikpũ ayetnummɛn, rimi hã umbi aka ikpo ififitamɛn.<verse eid="2CO 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, umɛn isi ĩbeemɛn umbi asheri ihwihwɛng ri ikpũ ayetnumkɛ umɛn iki ihwa ra abĩ Uasiya. Ayetnum hã awu arhɛrhɛ umɛn isi idɛ̃ɛ̃ ibimumɛn, umɛn isi ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ umɛn iwuri ĩbɛkmɛn. <verse eid="2CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9"/>Idzidzɛrhe, umɛn igũ ugɛɛ atsu umɛn ufai akpe. Bɔr akɛrɛ akorhe ngge itsú umɛn isi ítsumɛn amɛnmɛn ri ititɛ̃wãmɛn, bɔr umɛn itsu amɛnmɛn ru Unum, uwuku usoyiwe abika akpe. <verse eid="2CO 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10"/>Unga ashɔɔta umɛn ra akpe ha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">akpe ha</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Abvur akɔɔ aki itsɛng abok aki isha awu ru </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">akpe idikũnga irhɛirhɛ.</char></note>, umɛn ihwɛngmɛn unga awuri ishɔɔta umɛn ikɛi. Umɛn ifosa ugɛ unga awuri ishɔɔta umɛn ubɛn ivang, <verse eid="2CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11"/>ru ubokmbi aka ayika umɛn afɛna-Num ru umɛn. Mɔcɛ anera arhɛrhɛ aka itarwɛɛ ru Unum ru umɛn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ru umɛn</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Abvur akɔɔ aki itsɛng abok aki isha awu ru </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ru umbi.</char></note>, ubinkutsu umɛn iwuri ikpomɛn ishishɔɔr ha ri ifɛn-Num irhɛirhɛ.<verse eid="2CO 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uburhu afaruka ubinkpi <optbreak/> unga aka abee ikorhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12"/>Ubin hã ukpi umɛn iki ifĩrhã ru ukpɔ, amɛnmɛn adzaa umɛn ideka ugɛ isiseimɛn ru upfung iwe iyi idzidzɛrhe nu iyi irhirhika iki idzeku imimutu Unum. Isi idzekngge ri itsoi upfung ukpirɛ. Umɛn ĩdzumi ikorha akɛrɛ ri isiseimɛn nggu umbi. <verse eid="2CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13"/>Umɛn isi itsɛngamɛn ubinkpi umbi aka asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ avarhumbi use ahwɛngmbi. Umum ifosa ugɛ, <verse eid="2CO 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14"/>ru nyaka umbi icɛrɛ aka ahwɛng umɛn ukunjiir, unuma umbi awuri ihwɛngmbi akarhãrhã. Mɔcɛ umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ afĩrhũmbi ri itsimɛn, ru nyaka umɛn iki idɛ̃ɛ̃ ifĩrhã ri itsimbi ru unumkpi Uteijee Uyesu aki ibvui aba.<verse eid="2CO 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15"/>Umum ihwɛng rimi hã, ngge itsu umum ibee inggbaashia iyepa umbi, ngge itsú umbi akpo idorh idevaa. <verse eid="2CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16"/>Umum ĩbeemum iyepa umbi ni itɔng izĩ Umakidoniya, ni ibvui idzeku Umakidoniya ĩba ru umbi. Umum ikɛi ĩbeemum umbi ayika umum izĩ Uyahudiya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Aiy 19.21</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17"/>Ivangyɛ umum iki ibee ikorhe rimi hã, umbi akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛɛ umum iwe ra amɛn avaa? Use umum ikorhe ru nyaka abi upfung aki ikorhe iki itsu umum ĩgɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩĩ, ĩĩ&gt;&gt; bɔr ra amɛnmum iwu, &lt;&lt;Ĩ'ĩ, ĩ'ĩ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18"/>Ru nyaku Unum aka awu idzidzɛrhe, rimi hã arherhakɛ umɛn iki irherhuwa umbi asi iweke aki &lt;&lt;Ĩĩ&gt;&gt; nu &lt;&lt;Ĩ'ĩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19"/>Ungwɛ̃ Unum, Uyesu Ukiristo, umum nu Usirha nu Utimoti iki idũwã ru umbi, asi iwea uner &lt;&lt;Ĩĩ&gt;&gt; nu &lt;&lt;Ĩ'ĩ,&gt;&gt; bɔr awu uner &lt;&lt;Ĩĩ&gt;&gt; ubɛn ivang. <verse eid="2CO 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20"/>Ubinkutsu ibibemuweyɛ Unum aka abemuwa kishoo iwu &lt;&lt;Ĩĩ&gt;&gt; ru Ukiristo. Ngge itsu umɛn ĩgɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Iwerimi&gt;&gt; ru ubok Ukiristo ri ikpoi Unum. <verse eid="2CO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21"/>Awu Unum atsu umɛn nggu umbi idɛ̃ɛ̃ iker ru Ukiristo. Unga atsũ umɛn, <verse eid="2CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22"/>na atsuka umɛn atsar aka adɛyiwe ugɛ umɛn iwe abinga, na atsu Ipfunga ra amɛnmɛn ngge iwe ibow izɛɛ ni idzɛu ubinkpi uku iba ra asu.<verse eid="2CO 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23"/>Umum iyisu Unum unga awu idekamum ugɛ awu ubinkpi uku ikaa umbi utsu umum isi ibvui ĩbamum Ukorinti. <verse eid="2CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24"/>Isi iwengge ugɛ umɛn ibee idɛyiwa umbi ijee ri imangmangmbi, ubinkutsu umbi aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ akermbi ri imangmangmbi. Umɛn itɔ̃ itsera urhɔnga, ngge itsú umbi agũibɛn.<verse eid="2CO 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1"/>Ngge itsu umum isi ĩbeemum ĩba iyepa umbi ikɛi ni ĩdakuwe amɛnmbi. <verse eid="2CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2"/>Umum ĩba itsu amɛnmbi ada, ungamɔ abɔr aka itsu amɛnmum agũibɛn, uba asi iwea umbi umum iki itsu amɛnmbi ada? <verse eid="2CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3"/>Ubin hã uku utsu umum itsɛnga umbi rimi, umum isi ĩbeemum ĩba ikpo abirabɛ aka amɛ̃ɛ̃ umbɔ atsu umum inggɔmanggɔm, adakuwe amɛnmum. Umum iwemum ri ikeramɛn ru umbi kishoo, ugɛ umbi kishoo aba awembi ra anggɔm, umum iwuri iwe ra anggɔm. <verse eid="2CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4"/>Umum itsɛnga umbi nggu ida amɛn nu anyĩ arhɛrhɛ. Isi ĩbeemum itsu amɛnmbi aghong bɔr umum ibee umbi ahwɛng ighor ibibemamum ru umbi.<verse eid="2CO 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Itsũwe uvau uner arhim hã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5"/>Umum isi ĩbeemum ihwita arherhe ri ivangyɛ umum iki igɔr ĩgɛ uner ha aka atsu amɛn ada, asi idakuka amɛnmum ru nyaka amɛnmbi kishoo. <verse eid="2CO 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6"/>Ufaikpi irhɛɛmbi aka atsuke unga uku umɛ̃ɛ̃ mɔnɔ. <verse eid="2CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7"/>Nggee icɛrɛ, àka atsũwe unga na afituwe unga, ngge itsú ighongamɛn ineke ihwa ikernga. <verse eid="2CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8"/>Nggee umum ishɔ̃rhã umbi àka adɛyiwe ibibemambi ru unga akarhãrhã. <verse eid="2CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9"/>Ubin hã uku utsu umum itsɛnga umbi ubvur uwurɛ ikɛi, umum ibee ivira umbi inyãni use umbi abeembi idɔsa arherhamum kishoo. <verse eid="2CO 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10"/>Umum iwuri itsũwũkũ ubɛn unerwi umbi aka atsũwe. Abirabɛ umum iki itsũwe, umum itsũwe umbɔ ra asu Ukiristo. Unera aba awea umbɔ aki itsũwe, umum ikorha akɛrɛ ha ri iyika umbi. <verse eid="2CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11"/>Umum ikorha akɛrɛ ha utsur Ushaitan akpoa ugarh uku urhɛm umɛn, ubinkutsu umɛn ihwɛngmɛn irhirhɛmnga.<verse eid="2CO 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abi itser ibibemuwe-Num iyiki ifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12"/>Ivangyɛ umum iki izĩ Utoruwa, Uteijee unga adzaa umum ugarh ukpuku idzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyi Ukiristo umɔ. <verse eid="2CO 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13"/>Bɔr amɛnmum aghong akarhãrhã, ubinkutsu umum isi inyãmum ungwɛ̃mɛn Utitu umɔ. Nggee umum ibɔre abi Utoruwa ni izĩmum Umakidoniya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 20:1">Aiy 20.1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="2CO 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14"/>Bɔr umum itarwɛɛ ru Unum, uwuruwi aka agha inggbaashi, unga adarh umɛn ru nyaku ũgbaiwa aki idarh abirabɛ unga aka adzur ri iwa. Unum ani ikũ umɛn atsu ihwihwɛngnga itɛ̃rhã ru ubɛn ananga. Ihwihwɛng hã iwe ru nyaki isung iki itɛ̃rhã. <verse eid="2CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15"/>Umɛn iwe ru nyaki isung iyi Ukiristo, iyiriyɛ iki itɛ̃rhã ra abirabɛ umbɔ aka afɔrh umbɔ nu abirabɛ aka awe ru utsĩndĩ uwuku utsutsĩm. <verse eid="2CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16"/>Ra abirabɛ aka awe ru utsĩndĩ uwuku utsutsĩm, umɛn iwe inu akpe, ra abika afɔrh, umɛn iwe inu urhɛ. Awu ungamɔ amɛ̃ɛ̃ itɔ̃ itser ha? <verse eid="2CO 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17"/>Umɛn isi iwemɛn ru nyaka abɔɔ arhɛrhɛ, abika adzowe isarhe Arherhu-Num ugɛ umbɔ akpo uhwɛk. Bɔr umɛn irherhi idzidzɛrhe, ubinkutsu awu Unum adena umɛn, ikɛi umɛn iwe abi Ukiristo.<verse eid="2CO 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Abi itser ibibemuwe-Num iyiki ifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1"/>Umbi anyã ugɛɛ umɛn inu ikpoi atsimɛn ikɛi? Use umɛn ibee abvurkɛ aka idɛyiwa umbi ugɛ umɛn itɔ̃ itser iyiki ize, use abvurkɛ umbi aka itsɛng adɛyiwe abɔɔ ugɛ umɛn itɔ̃ itser iyiki ize? <verse eid="2CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2"/>Umbi nibikambi awu ubvurmɛn iki itsɛng ra amɛnmɛn, ugɛ ubɛn unera aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ avarhe na ahwɛng. <verse eid="2CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3"/>Umbi adɛyiwe ugɛ umbi awu ubvurwi Ukiristo aka atsɛng na adene ru ubok itsermɛn. Asi itsɛngmbɔ umbi nggu ubiro, bɔr nggu Ipfu-Num uwu urhɛ. Isi iwengge ru ubatu utarh bɔr iwu ra amɛn anera.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 24:12">Idzi 24.12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:33">Uiri 31.33</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 11:19">Ueze 11.19</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:26">36.26</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="2CO 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4"/>Umɛn itsu imangmang ru Unum ru ubok Ukiristo ngge itsu umɛn irherha akɛrɛ ha. <verse eid="2CO 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5"/>Umɛn ishimɛn ru ifɛrhkɔ ugɛ umɛn ikũ ikermɛn itɔ̃ itser iyɛrɛ, bɔr awu Unum atsu umɛn idɛ̃ɛ̃ itɔ̃ itser ha. <verse eid="2CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6"/>Unga atsu umɛn idɛ̃ɛ̃ iwe abika atɔ̃ itser iyi ibibemuwe-Num iyiki ifa, iyiriyɛ iki isi iwengge iyi ikpem bɔr iwe iyi Ipfu-Num. Ikpem iki isaki ififɛr, bɔr Ipfu-Num ikũwã urhɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:31">Uiri 31.31</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="2CO 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7"/>Íkpem Umusa iyiriyɛ iki itsɛng ru ubatu utarh ikũwã akpe. Irhirhang Unum idzekangge ri ivangyɛ umbɔ aka adzowe ngge ni itsu unyɛ̃ Umusa urhang akarhãrhã ngge itsu abi Uisrairha asi idɛ̃ɛ̃ arhimbɔ unyɛ̃ɛ̃nga. Irhirhang hã ru unyɛ̃ Umusa itirhi isisata. Uba ikpem hã iba nggu ikpũ irhirhang iyɛrɛ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 34:29">Idzi 34.29</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8"/>itser iyi Ipfu-Num isi íwe ru irhirhang inangngge irhirhang iyi Ikpem hã? <verse eid="2CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9"/>Uba ubinkpi uku ukũwã uvau uwe ubin irhirhang, mɔcɛ ubinkpi uku ukũwã umɛn isheru uvau uwuri iwe ru irhirhang unangkpɔ. <verse eid="2CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10"/>Idzidzɛrhe, irhirhang iyi ibibemuwe iki igbe isi itsĩngge irhirhang iyi ibibemuwe iyiki ifa. <verse eid="2CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11"/>Uba Ikpem iyiki imimaa uba nggu irhirhang, ubinkpi uku uwe ugbagbaa iwuri ikũwã nggaa irhirhang!<verse eid="2CO 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12"/>Umɛn iwe ru ikpũ ifosa iyɛrɛ, ngge itsu umɛn iwe ru ikeramɛn. <verse eid="2CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13"/>Umɛn isi iwemɛn ru nyaku Umusa, aka atsĩme unyɛ̃ɛ̃nga nggu untama utsur Uisrairha anyãmbɔ irhirhang hã iyiki imimaa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 34:33">Idzi 34.33</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14"/>Bɔr amɛnmbɔ awu uku undɔ̃ɔ̃, uba utsĩ icɛrɛ untama hã una ukɛnmgbɔ umbɔ inyã idzidzɛrhe ha ri ivangyɛ umbɔ iki ivarhi ibibemuwe-Num iki igbe ha. Awu iwe ru imangmang ru Ukiristo ukpekũ idɛ̃ɛ̃ itsũwe untama hã. <verse eid="2CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15"/>Uko irherɛ, ivangyɛ umbɔ iki ivarhu abvur Umusa, untama hã utsirmgbɔ amɛnmbɔ, ni itsu umbɔ asheri ihwihwɛng ra ake. <verse eid="2CO 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16"/>Bɔr unera aba adzipa awe uwu Uteijee, aka atsũwũkumbɔ untama hã.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 34:34">Idzi 34.34</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17"/>Uteijee awu Ipfu, anangkɛ Ipfu Uteijee iki iwe, ififɔn iwe umɔ ra anang hã. <verse eid="2CO 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18"/>Umɛn kishoo umbɔ aka asi itsirukumbɔ unyɛ̃mɛn, umɛn ĩdɛyiwe irhirhang Uteijee, ikɛi umɛn itoma iwe ru nyaka unga. Irhirhang ha idɛ̃ɛ̃ itoma. Akɛrɛ awu itser iyi Uteijee, unga awu Ipfu ha.<verse eid="2CO 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Iwe ru ubin ra anui abĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1"/>Awu ru ubok atorh Unum umɛn iki ikpo itser iyɛrɛ. Nggee, umɛn isi ítsũwũkumɛn amɛnmɛn. <verse eid="2CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2"/>Umɛn ikpɛ̃mɛn ikorhu ubin atsa ri iwɔk, umɛn isi irhɛmmɛn anera use umɛn isɔm igbɛrangwĩ nggu Arherhu-Num. Unum awu idekamɛn umɛn iki irherhi idzidzɛrhe ukpekũ, ngge itsú anera awe ru imangmang ru umɛn. <verse eid="2CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3"/>Uba Isarhe Iyiki Izeyɛ umɛn iki idũwã iwiwɔk, iwɔk ra abika atsutsĩm. <verse eid="2CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4"/>Ushaitan, unum uwu upfung ukpirɛ aka abvurka amɛn abika asheri imangmang, ngge itsú umbɔ asi ínyãmbɔ irhirhang Isarhe Iyiki Ize iki idɛyiwe imor Ukiristo, aka awu usaka Unum. <verse eid="2CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5"/>Umɛn isi idzowukumɛn isarhe atsimɛn, umɛn idzowe isarhe ugɛ Uyesu Ukiristo awu Uteijee. Ri itsinga umɛn iki iwe agãrhã ru umbi. <verse eid="2CO 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6"/>Ngge itsu Unum uwuku ugɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Neke irhirhang irhang ru uzĩ,&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 1:3">Ing 1.3</ref></char>.</note> unga atsu irhirhangnga irhang ra amɛnmɛn, itsu umɛn ihwɛng imornga. Anyã imor ha ra asu Ukiristo.<verse eid="2CO 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7"/>Bɔr abin aka awe ru ugarh aki Ipfu ha atsu ake ru umɛn, abirabɛ aka awe ru nyaka anui umbɔ aka akũ abĩ adzin. Unum akorha akɛrɛ adɛyiwe ugɛ ijee iyiriyɛ iki inangngge kishoo íjee iwu iyinga isi iwengge iyimɛn. <verse eid="2CO 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8"/>Umbɔ aka isaka adzaa umɛn ayetnum ru ubɛn afɛn, bɔr umbɔ asi itsu umɛn inekukumɛn itsermɛn. Ivang iyɔɔ umɛn icicang, bɔr umɛn isi itsũwũkumɛn amɛnmɛn. <verse eid="2CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9"/>Umbɔ adzaa umɛn uver, bɔr Unum asi ibɔruka umɛn. Umbɔ akwɛr umɛn atar ra abĩ, bɔr umɛn isi ikpemɛn. <verse eid="2CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10"/>Ubɛn ivang umbɔ akpurha abɔr ifɛre umɛn ru nyaka umbɔ aka akorhuwe Uyesu, ngge itsú umbɔ ama anyã urhɛwi uku uwe ru nyaku uwu Uyesu ru umɛn. <verse eid="2CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11"/>Umɛn abirabɛ iki iwe ru urhɛ, umɛn ishɔɔr ra akpe ubɛn ivang, ubinkutsu umɛn iwe ru imangmang ru Uyesu, nggee umbɔ ama anyã ibibɛknga ra ayormɛn akika akpe. <verse eid="2CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12"/>Nggee akpe atɔ̃ itser ru umɛn, bɔr urhɛ utɔ̃itser ru umbi.<verse eid="2CO 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iwemum ri imangmang, nggee umum irherha arherhe.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 116:10">Amb 116.10</ref></char>.</note> Umɛn iwe ru ikpũ imangmang hã, nggee umɛn irherhe igamɛn, <verse eid="2CO 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14"/>ubinkutsu umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ Unum uwuku usoyiwe Uteijee Uyesu ra akpe, awuri isoyiwanga umɛn nggu Uyesu na akũna umɛn nu umbi aba ra asunga. <verse eid="2CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15"/>Kishoo akɛrɛ unga akorhuwa umbi, ngge itsú imimutayɛ idɛ̃ɛ̃ itɛ̃rhã ima itsu anera atoma atar uwɛɛ ru Unum akarhãrhã, iyiriyɛ iki idzowe unga ikpikpoi.<verse eid="2CO 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16"/>Nggee umɛn isi itsũwũkumɛn amɛnmɛn. Ayormɛn anu ikpikpe, bɔr ubɛn unum ípfumɛn ikpo iker. <verse eid="2CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17"/>Ayetnummɛn awu ukunjiir asi ídãrhũke, ake awuri ikũwã umɛn ikpikpoi iyi ugbagbaa iyiriyɛ iki inangngge ayetnummɛn hã kishoo. <verse eid="2CO 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18"/>Nggee umɛn neke itsu asu ra abinkɛ umɛn iki idɛ̃ɛ̃ inyã, bɔr umɛn itsu asu ra abinkɛ umɛn iki isi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ inyãmɛn. Ubinkutsu, abinkɛ umɛn iki idɛ̃ɛ̃ inyã, asi ídãrhũke, bɔr abinkɛ iki isi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ inyãmɛn awu aki ugbagbaa.<verse eid="2CO 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Ayormɛn aka afa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1"/>Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ ayormɛn awe ru nyaka atsurha umɛn iki isei umɔ ri ivanga ukunjiir. Ikɛi umɛn iba ikpemɛn nu atsurha akɛrɛ atsĩmke, umɛn iwemɛn ri aya aka afa umɛn iki isei umɔ. Asi iwea anera adzin aya ha. Awu Unum adzin aya ha ra afã, ake awuri iwe aki ugbagbaa. <verse eid="2CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2"/>Umɛn iki izhemɛn nggu ayor akɛrɛ umɛn iki iwe ra ake icɛrɛ, umɛn ibee iwe ra ayormɛn aka afa ra afã. <verse eid="2CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3"/>Ubinkutsu ivangyɛ umɛn iki itsim ayor aka afa ha, umɛn isi íwemɛn ípfu ukpekũ ugɛɛ umɛn iwu igbĩrhĩ. <verse eid="2CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4"/>Ivangyɛ umɛn iki iwe ra atsurha akɛrɛ, umɛn itseng igɔ̃, ubinkutsu, umɛn isi ĩbeemɛn ikpe iwe igbĩrhĩ, bɔr umɛn ibee itsim ayor aka afã, ngge itsú ayorkɛ aka ikpe unuma afare awe akirakɛ aka asi íkpeke. <verse eid="2CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5"/>Awu Unum unga agbishuwa umɛn akɛrɛ ha, na adzaa umɛn Ipfunga ngge iwe ibow izɛɛ ubinkpi uku iba.<verse eid="2CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6"/>Nggee ubɛn ivang umɛn iwe ru ikeramɛn. Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ umɛn ĩba iwe ru ayor akɛrɛ, umɛn isi iwemɛn nggu Uteijee. <verse eid="2CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7"/>Umɛn isei ri imangmang ru Unum asi iwea ri inyĩnyã. <verse eid="2CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8"/>Umɛn iwemɛn ri ikeramɛn, umɛn ibee ibɔre ayormɛn ni isei nggu Uteijee. <verse eid="2CO 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9"/>Nggee umɛn itsu amɛnmɛn ru unga agũibɛn umɛn, ri isei ra ayormɛn use ri ida isei ra ake. <verse eid="2CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10"/>Ubinkutsu awu ufang umɛn kishoo iki izĩ ra anang isei aka atsu uvau Ukiristo. Ra anang isei ha ubɛn unera awuri iyɛi ugbɛtɛ abinkɛ unga aka akorhe ri iyor, iyiki ize use iyiki ibewe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 14:10">Urom 14.10</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="2CO 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyike anera agbisha nggu Unum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11"/>Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn idzowe imor ru Uteijee, ngge itsu umɛn ibee itsu anera adzipa azĩ ru unga. Ubinkpi umɛn iki iwe Unum ahwɛnga ukpɔ, umum ifosa ugɛ umbi ahwɛngmbi umɛn igambi. <verse eid="2CO 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12"/>Umɛn isi ibeemɛn ikpoi atsimɛn ra asumbi ikɛi, bɔr umɛn ĩdzaa umbi ugarha umbi akũ umɛn afĩrhã. Umɛn ikorha akɛrɛ ru umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ agbishuwe abirabɛ aki ifĩrhã ra abinkɛ umbɔ aki inyã nggu asu na asi ifĩrhũmbɔ ra abin aki amɛn.<verse eid="2CO 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13"/>Abɔɔ agɛ umɛn iwe abi ukpong. Umɛn ĩba iwu abi ukpong, ngge iwu ru Unum. Bɔr umɛn ĩba isi iwemɛn abi ukpong, izea iwu iyimbi. <verse eid="2CO 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14"/>Awu ibibemu Ukiristo idarh umɛn, ubinkutsu umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ Ukiristo aka akpea ru anera kishoo, nggee anera kishoo aka akpembɔ nggu unga. <verse eid="2CO 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15"/>Unga akpe ru anera kishoo, ngge itsú abika abubɛk niba abɛkmbɔ ri igũ ibɛnmbɔ bɔr ri igũna unga aka akpe umbɔ asoya unga. <verse eid="2CO 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16"/>Nggee udzur icɛrɛ uzĩɔ umɛn isi írhimɛn unera ugɛɛ ubinkpi upfung uku unyanga unga. Isha, umɛn isaki irhimɛn Ukiristo rimi hã, bɔr umɛn isi ibvui irhimɛn rimi icɛrɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17"/>Nggee, unera aba awɛrhunga iwɛrhɛ nggu Ukiristo, awu uner uwuku ufa. Iyiki igbe iki izĩngge, iyiki ifa iki ibangge! <verse eid="2CO 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18"/>Kishoo akɛrɛ ha adzeku Unum, uwuku ugbishuwa iwɛrhɛmɛn nggu unga ru ubok Ukiristo na adzaa umɛn itser igbigbisha. <verse eid="2CO 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19"/>Ubinkpi umɛn iki irherhe iwu ugɛ Unum agbishu upfung nggu itsikamnga ru ubok Ukiristo. Asi ívarhunga arhim anera ra atsimbɔ na adzaa umɛn itser iyiki ikũ anera ĩba ru unga. <verse eid="2CO 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20"/>Umɛn iwe afare Ukiristo, ngge itsu umɛn ini ishɔ̃rhã umbi ri itsok Ukiristo ugɛɛ Unum unga ani ishɔ̃rhã umbi ru ubokmɛn, ugɛ umbi agbisha nggu unga. <verse eid="2CO 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21"/>Unum atsu unga aka ashia ra arhim anyanga arhimmɛn ri itsinga, ngge itsú ru ubok Ukiristo, Unum ama anyanga umɛn iwu abika arhika.<verse eid="2CO 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1"/>Umɛn ishɔ̃rhã umbi ri itsimɛn iki iwe awɛrhi itser Unum, ugɛ umbi niba ayɛimbi imimutu Unum ibɛm. <verse eid="2CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2"/>Unga aka agɔr agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">&lt;&lt;Ivang umatamum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">umum igũmum umbi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">ru unum ififɔrh ha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">umum iyikamum umbi.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 49:8">Uish 49.8</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Umum idɛyiwa umbi, icɛrɛ awu ivang Unum aka iyike, icɛrɛ awu unum ififɔrh.<verse eid="2CO 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayetnum Uburhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3"/>Umɛn isi itsumɛn utarh ukpuku ukwɛr itok ru atsĩndĩ anera, ngge itsú anera asi írherhumbɔ arherhe aka abewe ri itsi itsermɛn. <verse eid="2CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4"/>Bɔr ru ubɛn ubin umɛn iki ikorhe, umɛn ini ĩdɛyiwe ugɛ umɛn iwe agãrhũ Unum. Umɛn ibima akarhãrhã ri ihwa ayetnum, ri igũ ighong nu ipipare. <verse eid="2CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5"/>Anera akwɛr umɛn ugwɛɛ na atsuke umɛn ru ugborzĩ. Anera asoyi unggɔ̃ɔ̃ ifuw nggu umɛn. Umɛn itɔ̃ itser iyiki iker, umɛn isi irhamɛn urhɔ, isi ighamɛn ubingha.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 16:23">Aiy 16.23</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6"/>Umɛn iwu abika asar, abi ihwihwɛng, abi idɔngamɛn, abi inna, abi Ipfu Isarsatangge, abi ibibema iyi idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="2CO 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7"/>Ubɛn ivang umɛn ini irherhi idzidzɛrhe, ijee Unum iwe nggu umɛn. Umɛn iwemɛn ra abin iwa aki irhirhika ru ubok ugha nu ubok ufer. <verse eid="2CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8"/>Umɛn iwu agãrhũ Unum ru ubok imor nu ikwikwɛɛte, ra arherhe aka abewe nu akika aze anera aki irherhuwa umɛn. Abɔɔ anyã umɛn ugɛɛ abika arhɛm anera, bɔr umɛn irherhi idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="2CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9"/>Umbɔ asi ihwɛngmbɔ umɛn, bɔr abɔɔ ahwɛngmbɔ umɛn akarhãrhã. Umɛn iwu ra angwĩ akpe, bɔr umɛn iwemɛn ru urhɛ. Umɛn iyɛi ugwɛɛ, bɔr umɛn isi ikpemɛn. <verse eid="2CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10"/>Umɛn iwemɛn ri idamɛn, bɔr umɛn iwe ra anggɔm ubɛn ivang. Umɛn iwe ri itsũwã, bɔr umɛn itsu abɔɔ awe ru ubin urhɛrhɛ. Umɛn ishimɛn ru ubin, bɔr ubɛn ubin umɛn iwemɛn ra ukpɔ.<verse eid="2CO 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11"/>Umɛn irherhuwa umbi arherhe isi iwɔkmɛn ubin ru umbi abi Ukorinti. Umɛn iyanguwa umbi amɛnmɛn. <verse eid="2CO 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12"/>Umɛn isi ikpɛ̃mɛn ibema umbi, awu umbi asi iyanga amɛnmbi abemumbi umɛn. <verse eid="2CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13"/>Umum irherha arherha akɛrɛ nggu umbi ru nyaku utei iki irherhe nggu angwɛ̃nga, àka ayanga amɛnmbi ikɛi.<verse eid="2CO 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Irhirhang nggu uzĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14"/>Niba agbopumbi atsimbi nggu abirabɛ aka asi iwembɔ abika adɔsa. Awu use uwuri igbopu uner uwuku urhika nggu uner arhim? Use awu iwɛrhɛ use iwuri igbopu irhirhang nggu uzĩ? <verse eid="2CO 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15"/>Ukiristo awu uwɛrhu Undenggũ? Use awu use utomu abika adɔsa nggu abirabɛ aka asi iwembɔ abika adɔsa? <verse eid="2CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16"/>Awu use uwuri igbopuwe Iya-Num nggu agberhe? Umɛn iwu iya Unum uwu urhɛ. Ru nyaku Unum aka agɔr agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">&lt;&lt;Umum iwuri isei nggu umbɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">ni izɛ̃rhã ru umbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">umum iwuri iwe Unummbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">umbɔ awuri iwe anermum.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 26:12">Urha 26.12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:38">Uiri 32.38</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:27">Ueze 37.27</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="2CO 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17"/>Nggee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">&lt;&lt;Àka adzeka ru umbɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">na agau atsimbi nggu umbɔ,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="2CO 6:17">Uteijee unga agɔr.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Àka niba abangumbi abinkɛ aka asi isarke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">umum iwuri iyesũ umbi.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:11">Uish 52.11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:34">Ueze 20.34</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 20:41">41</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="2CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18"/>&lt;&lt;Umum iwuri iwe Utɛ ru umbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">umbi awuri iwe angwɛ̃mum akatsak nu akatsɛrh,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="2CO 6:18">Unum Uwu Ijee Iyiki Igɔnga Kishoo unga agɔr.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2Usm 7.14</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="2CO 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1"/>Umbi aze awɛrha, umɛn iwemɛn ri ibibemuwe iyɛrɛ kishoo. Nggee, awu ufang umɛn isare atsimɛn ra abinkɛ aki itsu ida isisar ri iyor nu ipfu. Umɛn undzumu iwe abika asar ri igũ iwei Unum.<verse eid="2CO 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Anggɔm Uburhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2"/>Àka ayanguwa amɛnmbi ru umɛn. Umɛn isi ikorhumɛn iyiki ibewe ru unera. Umɛn isi idakukumɛn itsok unera. Umɛn isi ighamɛn urha unera. <verse eid="2CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3"/>Umum iki irherhe rimi hã, umum isi itsukamum umbi uvau. Ru nyaka umum iki idɛyiwa umbi ugɛ umbi awe ra anang ra amɛnmɛn ngge itsú umɛn iwe nggu umbi ru urhɛ nu akpe. <verse eid="2CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4"/>Umum itsu amɛnmum ru umbi akarhãrhã. Umum ikũ umbi ifĩrhã akarhãrhã. Umbi afituwa amɛnmum akarhãrhã. Umɛn ihwa ayetnum akarhãrhã, bɔr umum iwe ra anggɔm akarhãrhã.<verse eid="2CO 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5"/>Uko ivangyɛ umɛn iki iba Umakidoniya, ayormɛn asi ikpoke iwiwosha, bɔr ubɛn udĩkpi umɛn iki idzipa umɛn ihwa ayetnum. Ra awiya umbɔ ashɔng umɛn ifuw, ra amɛnmɛn umɛn igũ iwei.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 2:13">2Uko 2.13</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2CO 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6"/>Bɔr Unum uwuku ufituwe abika agũ ighong, afituwa umɛn ri ibiba Utitu. <verse eid="2CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7"/>Asi iwea ibibanga ukpekũ, bɔr ififituweyɛ umbi aka akorhuwe unga. Unga adɛyiwanga umɛn ugɛ umbi abeembi inyã umum, na awembi ri ighongamɛn ru ubinkpi umbi aka akorhe, na atsumbi amɛnmbi abeembi iyika umum. Akɛrɛ ha atsu umum igũibɛn akarhãrhã.<verse eid="2CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8"/>Uba umum itsu umbi agũ ighongamɛn ru ubvurwi umum iki itsɛnga umbi, umum isi igũmum ighongamɛn. Ivang iyɔɔ amɛnmum aghongke, ubinkutsu umum inyã ubvur ha itsuka umbi ighongamɛn, bɔr ighongamɛnmbi ha iwe ri ivanga ukunjiir ukpekũ. <verse eid="2CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9"/>Icɛrɛ umum iwe ra anggɔm, asi iwea ugɛ umbi aka agũ ighongamɛn, bɔr ighongamɛnmbi ngge itsu umbi adzipa. Unum akũ igũ ighongamɛn hã atsu umbi adzipa amɛnmbi, nggee umɛn isi ikorhuwamɛn umbi iyiki ibewe. <verse eid="2CO 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10"/>Ighongamɛn hã Unum aki ikũ, isaki itsu umbi adzipa. Idzidzipa ha ikũwã umbi ififɔrh, ni iwuri ishingge ri ighongamɛn. Bɔr ighongamɛn iyi upfung iki isaki itsu anera akpe. <verse eid="2CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11"/>Àka anyã ubinkpi uku ukorhe ru umbi ru ubok ighongamɛn hã Unum aka akũwã. Ngge itsu umbi akponi itɔ̃ itser iyiriyɛ iki idɛyiwe ugɛ umbi ashimbi ru uvau, ngge itsu umbi adzeidzeu ri ikpũ arhimkɛ aka awe ru umbi na agũ avɔm nggu ake. Ngge itsu umbi awe ru nggaa ikponi iyiki itsu ubinkpi uku usi irhikukpɔ urhika na atsu uvau ru uner uwuku ukorhe iyiki ibewe. Ru ubɛn anang umbi aka adɛyikumbi ugɛ umbi ashimbi ru uvau ra arherha akɛrɛ. <verse eid="2CO 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12"/>Nggee ivangyɛ umum iki itsɛng ubvur uwɔrɔ, asi iwea ubin uvau unera aka akorhe, use unerwi umbɔ aka akorhuwe unga itsu umum itsɛng umgbɔ. Umum itsɛng umgbɔ ngge itsú umbi anyã nggu asumbi ugɛ umbi abema umɛn akarhãrhã ra asu Unum. <verse eid="2CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13"/>Abin akɛrɛ kishoo atsu umɛn iwe ru ififita.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Undzuma abinkɛ aka atoma afituwa amɛnmɛn, umɛn iki inyã Utitu ra anggɔm, ubinkutsu umbi kishoo atsu ipfunga iwosha. <verse eid="2CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14"/>Ru ubɛn ififĩrhãmum iki ikorhe ri itsimbi ru Utitu, umbi asi idzaambi umum atsa. Ru nyaka ubɛn ubina umɛn iki irherhuwa umbi awe idzidzɛrhe, rimi hã umbɔ adɛyiwe ugɛ ififĩrhãmɛn ra atsimbi ra asu Utitu iwu idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="2CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15"/>Ibibemayɛ Utitu aka awerangge ru umbi itoma iwe akarhãrhã ivangyɛ unga aka iyita idɔsa arherhambi kishoo nu ikpũ imoryɛ umbi aka adzowe unga ri ivangyɛ umbi aka ayɛi unga nggu iwei nu izang iyor. <verse eid="2CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16"/>Umum iwe ra anggɔm icɛrɛ ubinkutsu umum iwemum ri ikeramɛn ru umbi.<verse eid="2CO 7:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Àka adzowe abinkɛ umbi <optbreak/> aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ adzowe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, umɛn ibee umbi ahwɛng imimutayɛ Unum aka adzowe ikpui ikikɔng abika adɔsa ru Umakidoniya. <verse eid="2CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2"/>Ra ateu nggaa ayetnummbɔ nu itsũwãmbɔ, arhɛrha anggɔmmbɔ itsu umbɔ adzowe ízũwã ra abɔɔ akarhãrhã. <verse eid="2CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3"/>Umum idɛ̃ɛ̃ idɛyiwamum umbi ugɛ umbɔ adzowe uku kpengkpeng ri ikermbɔ, utsɛku umbɔ aka adzowe ngge itɔngngge ikermbɔ. Ri ibibemambɔ, <verse eid="2CO 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4"/>umbɔ ashɔ̃rhã umɛn akarhãrhã ugɛ umɛn neke umbɔ akpo idorh ri itsu abokmbɔ atosa ayike abika adɔsa ru Urusharhima.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 15:26">Urom 15.26</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5"/>Akorha anangmbɔ ubinkpi umɛn iki ikaifɛrhkɔ. Umbɔ agbaashia adzowe atsimbɔ ru Uteijee mɔcɛ umbɔ adzaa atsimbɔ ru umɛn ri idɔsu ubin Unum aka abee. <verse eid="2CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6"/>Nggee umɛn ishɔ̃rhũ Utitu ugɛ unga amina asunga amashu itseryɛ unga aka atsai na ayika umɛn ri ikɔng izũwã iyi ibibema ru umbi. <verse eid="2CO 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7"/>Umbi aka akorha anangmbi ra abina kishoo ri imangmang, ra arherhe, ri ihwihwɛng, ri ikponi itɔ̃ itser nu ibibemambi ru umɛn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ibibemambi ru umɛn</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Abvur akɔɔ aki itsɛng abok aki isha awu ru </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ibibemamɛn iki ikorhuwa umbi.</char></note>, àka akorha anangmbi rimi hã ikɛi ri idzowe izũwã iyɛrɛ iki idzek ri ibibema.<verse eid="2CO 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8"/>Umum isi itsukamum umbi inggang, bɔr umum ibee iviri idzidzɛrhe ibibemambi ri ikpanga ngge nggu abɔɔ aka awe ru ikponi iki iyiyike. <verse eid="2CO 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9"/>Umbi ahwɛngmbi imimuta Uteijeemɛn Uyesu Ukiristo, unga awu uner abina kishoo, bɔr ri itsimbi unga awe utsũwã, ngge itsú umbi awe abika awe ru ubin ru ubok itsũwãnga.<verse eid="2CO 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10"/>Itsũwãmum iyɛ ru ubinkpi uku uze ru umbi ra arherhe akɛrɛ. Ishaikɛ umbi awu anggbaashi asi iwea ri idzidzowe ukpekũ, bɔr nggu amɛn aka akponi idzowe. <verse eid="2CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11"/>Nggee icɛrɛ àka amashi itser ha nggu amɛn aka akponi idzowe ha umbi aka atsai na adzowe ubinkpi umbi aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ adzowe. <verse eid="2CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12"/>Umbi aba awembi ra amɛn aka adzowe, Unum awuri iyɛsa ubinkpi umbi aka adzowe. Unum atsu asunga ru ubinkpi unera aka awerakpɔ, asi iwea ru ubinkpi unera aka ashe rakpɔ.<verse eid="2CO 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13"/>Asi iwea ibibemamum ugɛ abɔɔ awosha nu umbɔ apara umbi ri iker, bɔr umum ibee umbi kishoo awe icaica. <verse eid="2CO 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14"/>Ri ivang iyɛrɛ umbi aka awe ru arhɛrha abin, àka akũ ayike abɔɔ ra abinkɛ umbɔ aka abee, ngge itsú umbɔ ivangyɛ umbɔ aka awe ra abin arhɛrhɛ, umbɔ awuri ikũ ayikambɔ umbi ra abinkɛ umbi aka abee. Mɔcɛ abina awe icaica. <verse eid="2CO 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15"/>Ru nyaku itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Uwuruwi aka akɔng arhɛrhɛ, asi irhɛke unga. Uwuruwi aka akɔng ukunjiir, asi ibɔrkeci ru unga.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 16:18">Idzi 16.18</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="2CO 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utitu nggu awɛrhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16"/>Bɔr umum itar uwɛɛ ru Unum, unga aka atsu ra amɛn Utitu ru nyaka amɛnmum aka awe ru umbi. <verse eid="2CO 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17"/>Utitu asi iyɛsa ubinkpi umɛn iki ishɔ̃rhã ukpekũ, bɔr unga atsu amɛnnga abee iyika umɛn, ngge itsu unga asɛng itsinga aba ru umbi. <verse eid="2CO 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18"/>Umɛn ikɛi idene ungwɛ̃mɛn nggu unga, uwuruwi aka akpo ikpikpoi ri kishoo ikikɔng abika adɔsa ri idzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize. <verse eid="2CO 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19"/>Asi iwea rimi ukpekũ, bɔr awu umbɔ asɛng unga azɛ̃rhã nggu umɛn ri ikũ izũwã iyɛrɛ izĩ Urusharhima. Umɛn ikorha ngge ru umɛn ikpoi Uteijee ni ĩdɛyiwe ugɛ umɛn iwemɛn ra amɛn akika ayike. <verse eid="2CO 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20"/>Umɛn isi ĩbeemɛn anera arhena umɛn ri itser iyiki idzowe urhɛrhi izũwã hã. <verse eid="2CO 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21"/>Umɛn ibee ikorhe abin aka arhika ra asu Uteijee nu ra asu anera ikɛi.<verse eid="2CO 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22"/>Ikɛi umɛn idene umbɔ nggu ungwɛ̃mɛn uwuruwi umɛn iki inyã ugɛ unga adzowe itsinga atɔ̃ itser ra abina arhɛrhɛ. Icɛrɛ unga abee ikorha ananga rimi, ubinkutsu unga awea ri ikeramɛn ru umbi akarhãrhã. <verse eid="2CO 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23"/>Utitu awu uwɛrhi itsermum uwuku uyika umbi. Angwɛ̃mɛn abɔɔ aka awu nggu unga, awu abi itser ikpui ikikɔng abika adɔsa na akowe imor ru Ukiristo. <verse eid="2CO 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24"/>Nggee aka adɛyiwe aner abɛrɛ ibibemambi, ngge itsú abika adɔsa kishoo ahwɛng ugɛ ififĩrhãmɛn ru umbi iwu idzidzɛrhe.<verse eid="2CO 8:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Àka ayike abika adɔsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1"/>Ri iyike abika adɔsa ha, asi iwea ufang umum itsɛnga umbi, <verse eid="2CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2"/>ubinkutsu umum ihwɛngmum itsu amɛnmbi ri iyiyike. Umum ifĩrhã ri itsimbi ru Umakidoniya. Umum ĩgɔr umbɔ ugɛ ngge utirhi ishaikɛ ru Uakaya umbi aka agbisha abinkɛ umbi aka idzowe amaa. Ikpũ itsu amɛnmbi hã itsu irhɛɛ abɔɔ ru umbɔ asok adɛ̃ɛ̃. <verse eid="2CO 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3"/>Ngge itsu umum idene angwɛ̃mɛn abɛ, ngge itsú umbɔ anyã ugɛ ubinkpi umum iki ifĩrhã ri itsimbi ra arherhe akɛrɛ awu idzidzɛrhe. Umum ibee umbi agbisha adzɛu ru nyaka umum iki irherhe ugɛ umbi awuri ikorhumbi. <verse eid="2CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4"/>Bɔr umum ĩba idzeku Umakidoniya nggu abɔɔ abika adɔsa ĩba ikpo umbi anasi igbishumbi ubin, atsa awuri ifɛr umɛn ri iker amɛnyɛ umɛn iki iwerangge ru umbi nu umbi awuri igũmbi atsa ikɛi. <verse eid="2CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5"/>Nggee umum inyã azea umum ishɔ̃rhã angwɛ̃mɛn hã aba akɔng abinkɛ umbi aka abemi idzidzowe ru umum idɔrhi iba, ngge itsú ake anu adzɛu ru nyaki izũwãyɛ umbi aka adzowe ri ibibemambi, isi iwengge ri inggang.<verse eid="2CO 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6"/>Àka ayita ugɛ ubɛn unera aka adoi ikpũ ukunjiir, awuri igbɛr ukunjiir, bɔr unerwi aka adoi ikpũ irhɛirhɛ, awuri igbɛr abina arhɛrhɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7"/>Ubɛn unera atsũ ra amɛnnga ubinkpi unga aka abemi idzowe na adɔrha adzowe, asi iwea ri ighongamɛn use ri inggang, ubinkutsu Unum abemu uner uwuku udzowe nggu anggɔm. <verse eid="2CO 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8"/>Unum ikɛi adɛ̃ɛ̃ adzaanga umbi imimutayɛ iki inangngge ubinkpi umbi aka abee, ngge itsú ubɛn ivangyɛ umbi aka ikpo kishoo abinkɛ umbi aka abee, umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ akorhumbi ubɛn itser iki uze. <verse eid="2CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9"/>Ru nyaku itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">&lt;&lt;Unga aka isaka ayangu uboknga adzowe ra atsũwã.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">Irhirhikanga iwu ugbagbaa.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 112:9">Amb 112.9</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="2CO 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10"/>Unga uwuku udzowe ikpũ ru abika ududoi nu uborodi uwe ubingha, awuri itoma adzaanga umbi ikpũ na atsu ngge iwe irhɛrhɛ na atsu umbi agbɛr abin arhɛrhɛ. Unga awuri ikorhe rimi hã, ngge itsú umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ adzowe abirabɛ aka abee. <verse eid="2CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11"/>Unga awuri itsu umbi awe ru ubin ra atsĩndĩa kishoo, ngge itsú umbi ayanga abokmbi adzowe ru ubɛn ifɛrhɛ. Mɔcɛ anera awuri itarwɛɛ ru Unum ri izũwãyɛ umbi aka adzowe ru ubokmɛn.<verse eid="2CO 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12"/>Itseryɛ umbi aka atɔ̃ isi iyikungge abika adɔsa ukpekũ, bɔr ini itsu anera arhɛrhɛ atar uwɛɛ akarhãrhã ru Unum. <verse eid="2CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13"/>Awu itseryɛ umbi aka atɔ̃ iwuri itsu umbɔ akpoi Unum. Awu idzidzoweyɛ umbi aka adzowe ru umbɔ nu ru abɔɔ kishoo iwuri idɛyiwe ugɛ umbi awu abika adɔsa arherhe ri Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyi Ukiristo. <verse eid="2CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14"/>Awu nggaa imimutayɛ Unum aka adzaa umbi itsu umbi ayike umbɔ. Akɛrɛ ha atsu umbɔ adɛ̃ɛ̃ ifɛna-Num ru umbi na abee inyã umbi. <verse eid="2CO 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15"/>Umɛn itarwɛɛ idzowe Unum ru nggaa izũwãyɛ unga aka akorhuwa umɛn, iyiriyɛ angwĩ aka asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ asɔm amaake!<verse eid="2CO 9:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Uburhu akaa itsernga ru Unum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1"/>Abɔɔ ani igɔr ugɛ umum iwu uner iwei ni ishimum ru ikeramɛn ra asumbi, bɔr umum iwu uner ikeramɛn ri ivangyɛ umum iki ishimum ru umbi! <verse eid="2CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2"/>Abɔɔ agɛ ibibɛkmɛn iwe ru nyaka abi upfung. Umum Uburhu, umum ishɔ̃rhã umbi ri ididɔɔr nu irhɛrhi itsi iyi Ukiristo, àka niba atsu umum iwemum uner ikeramɛn nggu umbi ru nyaka umum iki ibee iwu uner ikeramɛn nggu abɔrɔ ha. <verse eid="2CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3"/>Nu ngge iki iwe ugɛ umɛn iwe ru upfung, umɛn isi itangmɛn iwa ru nyaku upfung iki ikorhe. <verse eid="2CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4"/>Abin iwamɛn asi iweke aki upfung ukpirɛ. Awu aki ijee Unum, akirakɛ umɛn iki ikũ ibupuwe ifɛrhkɔ iyiki iker iki itsu anera ayapa. <verse eid="2CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5"/>Umɛn iki isaki itsu ubɛn imesa iyiki iberi itsi iki ikɛn anera ihwɛng Unum iwe ibɛm. Ikɛi umɛn iki isaki ivur ifɛrhkɔ ha kishoo itsu ngge idɔsu Ukiristo. <verse eid="2CO 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6"/>Ivangyɛ umbi aka adɛyiwe ugɛ umbi awu abika adɔsu ubinkpi Ukiristo aka agɔr, mɔcɛ umɛn igbisha idzɛu itsu ufai ru ubɛn unerwi aka akpɛ̃ɛ̃ idɔsu ubɛn ubinkpi Ukiristo aka agɔr.<verse eid="2CO 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7"/>Ubɛn unerwi aka awe ru ikeramɛn agɛ unga awu uwu Ukiristo, aze unga ahwɛng ugɛ umɛn iwu abi Ukiristo igamɛn. Akɛrɛ ha awu uku ukpɛ̃ɛ̃. <verse eid="2CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8"/>Uteijee adzaa umum ijee iyiki ikũ idzin umbi ni isi iwengge iyiki ibupuwe umbi. Uko ififĩrhãmum iba irhɛngge ri ijee ha, umum isi ígũmum atsa. <verse eid="2CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9"/>Umum isi ĩbeemum umbi akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ umum ibee idzaa umbi iwei nggu abvurkɛ umum iki itsɛnga umbi. <verse eid="2CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10"/>Abɔɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Abvur Uburhu amor na aker, bɔr unga aba awu nggu umɛn nibikanga, asi iwea unerwi iki irherha arherhi iker, ikɛi arherhanga asi iweke ubin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11"/>Imɛ̃ngge ikpũ anera abɛrɛ ahwɛng ugɛ abinkɛ umɛn iki itsɛng ra abvurmɛn ri ivangyɛ umɛn iki ishimɛn umɔ, abin hã rakɔ umɛn iki ikorhe umɛn ĩba iwemɛn umɔ.<verse eid="2CO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12"/>Umɛn isi ĩbeemɛn imei use ikpanga atsimɛn nggu abirabɛ aka akpoi atsimbɔ. Bɔr ivangyɛ umbɔ iki imei atsimbɔ nibikambɔ na akpanga atsimbɔ nggu adɔkambɔ, umbɔ ashimbɔ ri ihwihwɛng. <verse eid="2CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13"/>Umɛn isi ibeemɛn ifĩrhã inangmɛn ubinkpi uku uwe, bɔr umɛn iwuri ifĩrhã idɛ̃ɛ̃ ru ubinkpi Unum aka adzaa umɛn. Akɛrɛ atoma nggu itseryɛ umɛn iki itɔ̃ ru umbi. <verse eid="2CO 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14"/>Umɛn isi ifari itɔngmɛn ubinkpi Unum aka adzaa umɛn. Umɛn isi ífĩrhũmɛn ri itsimbi, umɛn iba inasi ĩbamɛn ru umbi. Bɔr umɛn igbaashia inyangu uzãrhã uku uder ikũ Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyi Ukiristo ĩba ru umbi. <verse eid="2CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15"/>Umɛn isi ifĩrhã inangmɛn ubinkpi Unum aka adzaa umɛn. Umɛn isi iyɛimɛn ikpikpoi ri itser abɔɔ. Bɔr ifosamɛn iwe ugɛ imangmangmbi itoma, mɔcɛ itseryɛ umɛn iki itɔ̃ ru umbi iwuri itoma akarhãrhã, <verse eid="2CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16"/>ngge itsú umɛn idzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize ra abĩ akɔɔ aka awe ra asu uteumbi. Umɛn iwuri ikorha ake ni isi ífĩrhũmɛn ri itsi itseryɛ abɔɔ aka atɔ̃.<verse eid="2CO 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Uneke uwuku ufufĩrhã, afĩrhã ru Uteijee.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Uiri 9.24</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2CO 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18"/>Asi iwea uwuruwi aka akpoi itsinga awuri iyɛi imor, bɔr uwuruwi Uteijee aka akpoi.<verse eid="2CO 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Uburhu nu abi itser Uyesu igbɛrangwĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1"/>Umum ifosa umbi awuri idɔng amɛnmbi ru ungwɛ̃rhũ ugugge ha umum iki ikorhe. Kabɔɔ àka awe nggu umum! <verse eid="2CO 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2"/>Umum ĩbema umbi nggu ibibema iyi Unum. Umum ĩbemuwa utsa uwɔɔ unga awe utsakmbi, utsa ha awu Ukiristo. Umum ibee idzowe umbi ru unga ru nyaku usarkasar unakugbĩrhĩ aka anasi ihwɛnga ukutsak. <verse eid="2CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3"/>Bɔr umum igũ iwei ugɛ awuri irhɛm umbi na atsu umbi ayapa ri idɔsu Ukiristo nggu idzidzɛrhe nu isisar, ru nyaki ibvui iki irhɛm Uhawa'u nggu igbɛrangwĩ. <verse eid="2CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4"/>Umum igũ iwei ha ubinkutsu unera aba adzaa umbi isarhe Uyesu uwɔɔ aka asi iwea Uyesu uwu ha umɛn iki ĩdzaa umbi, umbi akpurha ayɛi ngge. Umbi ikɛi abeembi iyɛi ipfu iyɔɔ nu isarhe iyiki ize iyɔɔ, iyiriyɛ iki iwiwengge nggu iyiriyɛ umbi aka ayɛi ru umɛn. <verse eid="2CO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5"/>Umum isi ikakũ ifɛrhkɔ ugɛ umum ibɔtũci ri iwu icaica nggu abɛrɛ ha umum iki igbaashia ĩba ru umbɔ, abirabɛ aka anyanga atsimbɔ agɛ umbɔ awu nggaa abi itser Uyesu. <verse eid="2CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6"/>Nu ngge iki iwe ugɛ umum isi idɛ̃ɛ̃ irherhumum arherhe ugɛɛ abika ahwɛng arherhe, umum iwemum ri ihwihwɛng. Umɛn iki ĩdɛyiwamɛn umbi akɛrɛ ha ru ubɛn utsĩndĩ.<verse eid="2CO 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7"/>Umum ĩdzaa umbi Isarhe Iyiki Ize izũwã. Ri ivangyɛ umum iki ikorha aki ha, umum ikorha arhim ri irhɛrhi itsimum ngge itsú umbi abera afafã? <verse eid="2CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8"/>Umum iyɛi uhwɛk ri ikikɔng abika adɔsa abɔɔ ikũ itɔ̃wã itser ru umbi. <verse eid="2CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9"/>Ivangyɛ umum iki iwe nggu umbi ni ibee ubin, umum isi iparumum unera, ubinkutsu angwɛ̃mɛn abika adzeku Umakidoniya umbɔ ayika umum nggu ubinkpi umum iki ibee. Ri ivang iyɔrɔ, umum isi iparumum umbi, ikɛi umum isi íparumum umbi ru ubɛn utsĩndĩã. <verse eid="2CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10"/>Idzidzɛrhe Ukiristo iki iwe nggu umum itsu umum ĩgɔr ugɛ, unera ashia ra abĩ Uakaya aka ikɛn umum ififĩrhã iyɛrɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11"/>Umum isi ĩbemumum umbi ngge itsu umum irherha akɛrɛ ha? Unum ahwɛnga umum ĩbemumum umbi. <verse eid="2CO 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12"/>Bɔr umum idɛ̃ɛ̃ isarumum ri ikpɛ̃ɛ̃ iyɛi uhwɛk ru umbi, ngge itsú umum ikɛn nggaa abi itser Uyesu ha ugarh ukpuku ufĩrhã ugɛ umbɔ atɔ̃ itser icaica nggu umɛn.<verse eid="2CO 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13"/>Ikpũ anera abɛrɛ awe abi itser Uyesu igbɛrangwĩ, awu abika arhɛm anera, atsu atsimbɔ awe abi itser Uyesu Ukiristo. <verse eid="2CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14"/>Asi iwea ubin idzeu, ubinkutsu, Ushaitan nibikanga aka isaka ayani itsinga ru umbɔ anyã unga awe ugɛɛ ipfu Itser-Num iyi irhirhang. <verse eid="2CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15"/>Asi iwea ubin idzeu ugɛ abi itsernga ikɛi ayana atsimbɔ ru umbɔ anyã umbɔ awe ugɛɛ abi itser iyi irhirhika. Ri imimasha umbɔ awuri ikpombɔ itosayɛ iki iwe uku kpengkpeng nggu itsermbɔ.<verse eid="2CO 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uburhu afĩrhã ru ayetnumnga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16"/>Umum ibvui irherhe, unera niba agɔra ugɛ umum iwu ugugge. Bɔr umbi aba agɔrmbi rimi hã, mɔcɛ aka ayɛi umum ru nyaka umbi aka ayɛi ugugge, ngge itsú umum ifĩrhã ukunjiir. <verse eid="2CO 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17"/>Asi iwea ugɛ Uteijee atsu umum ifĩrhã, bɔr umum irherhe ru nyaku ugugge. <verse eid="2CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18"/>Ngge iki iwe ugɛ abɔɔ afĩrhã ru nyaka anera ru upfung iki ikorhe, umum igamum iwuri ifĩrhũmum. <verse eid="2CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19"/>Umbi akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ umbi asarasu, bɔr umbi abima nggu agugge ra anggɔm! <verse eid="2CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20"/>Idzidzɛrhe, umbi abimumbi nggu ubɛn unera aka atsu umbi igãrhã use avur abinmbi use unga abvuta umbi, use unga akwɛɛte umbi use akwɛr umbi ra asumbi. <verse eid="2CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21"/>Umum isi ĩgũmum atsa ugɛ umɛn ishimɛn ra amɛn aka akorhe abina akɛrɛ ha!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Umum irherhe ru nyaku ugugge. Abinkɛ ubɛn unera aka ifĩrhã, umum ikɛi iwuri ifĩrhũmum ra ake. <verse eid="2CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22"/>Umbɔ awe abi Uyahuda? Umum iwe rimi hã. Umbɔ awe abi Uisrairha? Umum iwe rimi hã. Umbɔ awe unang Uibrahim? Umum iwe rimi hã. <verse eid="2CO 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23"/>Umbɔ awu abi itser Ukiristo? Umum inang umbɔ. Umum irherhe ugɛɛ uner ukpong. Umum itɔ̃ itser inangmum umbɔ, umum itsĩ ru ugborzĩ inangmum umbɔ, umbɔ akwɛr umum idikunga irhɛirhɛ, ni icɔrha akpe idikunga irhɛirhɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 16:23">Aiy 16.23</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24"/>Idikũnga itɔ̃ɔ̃ anggbaashi abi Uyahuda aka akwɛr umum asharhe isɔka itaar nu utɔɔrha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">asharhe isɔka itaar nu utɔɔrha</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Akɛrɛ ake awu ufai utsotsorakpɔ umbɔ aka itsuke uner abi Uyahuda. Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 25:1-3">Iva 25.1-3</ref></char>.</note>. <verse eid="2CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25"/>Idikũnga itaar umbɔ aka akwɛr umum nggu igbong. Umbɔ aka atangmbɔ atarh ru umum idikũnga unying. Idikũnga itaar akhukhɔɔ amɛ̃ aka ayarke ra akau akagɔng nggu umum. Umum iki iyangmum ru ukau ukugɔng utsuu nu atenum.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 16:22">Aiy 16.22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:19">14.19</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2CO 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26"/>Ru irhɛ uzɛ̃rhãmum, umum iki itsĩmum ayetnum arhɛrhɛ. Umum ikpo ayetnum ra azɛ̃, ru ubok avɛu, ru ubok abimɛn, ra abok abirabɛ aka asi iwembɔ abi Uyahuda, ri iteu iki igɔng, ra arhum, ra akau akagɔng, ikɛi ra abok angwɛ̃mɛn abi igbɛrangwĩ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Aiy 9.23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:15">14.15</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27"/>Umum ĩhwa ayetnum ri itsermum nu ida urhɔ nu imerh nu ugɔ̃ amɛ̃, ikɛi inuma irhɛirhɛ umum isi ikpomum ubingha. Umum igũmum ighɛnga nu atorhamum asi irhɛke. <verse eid="2CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28"/>Asi iwea abina akɛrɛ ha ukpekũ, ubɛn unuma umum iwe ru imor iyiki irhi ikikɔng abika adɔsa kishoo. <verse eid="2CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29"/>Uwukusong asheri iker, umum isi iwemum ru nyaka ha? Uwukusong umbɔ aka atsu unga agba ra arhim, nu ake asi ighongke amɛnmum?<verse eid="2CO 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30"/>Aba awu ufang umum iki ifĩrhã, umum iwuri ifĩrhã nggu abinkɛ aka adɛyiwa ididɔ̃rhãmum. <verse eid="2CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31"/>Unum nu Utɛ Uteijee Uyesu, uwu umbɔ aka idzowe unga igɔng ugbagbaa, ahwɛnga ugɛ umum isi igbɛrmum angwĩ. <verse eid="2CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32"/>Ru Udimashku, ugomna uwuruwi aki itɔ̃we itser ru uyɛrhe Uareta atsu umbɔ adzɛu angwĩ ufɔm uteu Udimashku kishoo ru unga adzur umum. <verse eid="2CO 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33"/>Bɔr awɛrhamum atsu umum ru uzing na acipuwe umum ru angwĩ ugba ufɔm utepa, umum ishɔɔr ru uboknga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 9:23-25">Aiy 9.23-25</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="2CO 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Abinkɛ Uyesu aka adɛyiwe <optbreak/> Uburhu ri irhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1"/>Ikɛi awu ufang umum ifĩrhã. Umum ihwɛngmum ugɛ ishingge ru ugarh, bɔr umum iwuri irherhe ri itsi irhi nu abin aka awɔkɛ Uteijee aka idɛyiwa umum. <verse eid="2CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2"/>Umum ihwɛng utsawɔɔ aka awu uner uwuku udɔsu Ukiristo. Aka awu imɛka usɔka nu anaa icɛrɛ umbɔ aka ashupa unga azĩ ra afã aki untaar. Umum isi ihwɛngmum use utsa ha awea ri iyor use ashia, bɔr Unum ahwɛnga. <verse eid="2CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3"/>Umum ihwɛng ugɛ akũ utsak uwurɛ azĩ ra afã. Umum isi ihwɛngmum use utsa ha awea ri iyor use ashia, bɔr Unum ahwɛnga. <verse eid="2CO 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4"/>Unga agũa arherha akirakɛ unera aka asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ arherhunga, ikɛi akɛnmbɔ unera irherha ake. <verse eid="2CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5"/>Umum ifĩrhũmum ri itsi unera ru nyaka ha, bɔr umum isi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ ifĩrhũmum ri itsimum. Umum ikpurhi ifĩrhã ri ididɔngmum. <verse eid="2CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6"/>Umum ĩba iwuri ififĩrhã, umum isi íwemum ugugge, ubinkutsu umum iwuri irherhe idzidzɛrhe. Bɔr isi ífĩrhũmum, utsur unera inyanga umum ananga ubinkpi unga aka anyã umum ikorhe na agũ umum irherhe.<verse eid="2CO 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7"/>Nggaa abin aka awɔkɛ Uteijee aka adɛyiwa umum adɛ̃ɛ̃ atsuke umum iberi itsi. Nggee umbɔ adzaa umum ubin ukpɔɔ uku itsu iyormum ihwa ayetnum. Akɛrɛ ha akɛn umum iberi itsi, awu Ushaitan adene ake adzaa umum ayetnum. <verse eid="2CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8"/>Idikunga itaar umum iki ishɔ̃rhũ Uteijee unga ama anyanguwe ubin hã ru umum, <verse eid="2CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9"/>bɔr unga agɔr umum agɛ, &lt;&lt;Imimutamum imɛ̃ mɔnɔ ru ungo, ubinkutsu ijeemum iwuri itsuifɛr ri ididɔng.&gt;&gt; Nggee umum iwuri ifĩrhã nggu anggɔm akarhãrhã ri itsi ididɔ̃rhãmum, ngge itsú ijee Ukiristo ima iwe ru umum. <verse eid="2CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10"/>Nggee, umum igũmum ibɛn ididɔ̃rhã, urhena, inyã ayer, uver nu ikikɔka ri itsi Ukiristo, ubinkutsu umum ĩba ididɔ̃rhã, umum iwe ru iker.<verse eid="2CO 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ighongamɛn Uburhu ru abika adɔsa <optbreak/> ru Ukorinti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11"/>Umum itsu itsimum iwu ugugge, bɔr awu umbi atsu umum iwe. Idzidzɛrhe, irhikungge umbi akpoi umum, ubinkutsu uwɔɔ asi inangnga umum ru nggaa abi itser Uyesu abɛrɛ, nu ngge iki iwe ugɛ umum isi iwemum ubin. <verse eid="2CO 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12"/>Abinkɛ aki idɛyiwe ugɛ unera awu uner itser Uyesu uwu idzidzɛrhe akorha ake ru umbi nggu ibibima akarhãrhã. Ake awu atsar nu abin idzeu nu kishoo itser iki idɛyiwe ijee Unum. <verse eid="2CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13"/>Awu ra atsĩndĩ akasong umum iki idɛyiwa ugɛ umbi asi iwembi icaica nggu abika adɔsa abɔɔ? Umum iki isi iparumum umbi idzaa umum ubin. Àka ama atsũwã umum ru igbigba ha!<verse eid="2CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14"/>Umum iwuri iba iyepa umbi ide untaar. Umum isi íparumum umbi adzaa umum ubin, ubinkutsu isi ĩbeemum abinmbi bɔr umum ibeea umbi. Asi iwea awɛkaci awuri ikɔng abin adzowe ra ateimbɔ, bɔr ateimbɔ awuri ikɔng abin adzowe ra angwɛ̃mbɔ. <verse eid="2CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15"/>Nggee umum iwuri igũibɛn ri ifɛre ubinkpi umum iki iwerakpɔ kishoo ni idzowe itsimum ikɛi ri iyika umbi. Umum ĩba ibema umbi akarhãrhã, umbi awuri ibema umum ukunjiir?<verse eid="2CO 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16"/>Umbi awuri ibemumbi ugɛ umum isi íparumum umbi idzaa umum ubin. Bɔr uwɔɔ agɔr ugɛ umum ĩbvuta umbi, umum ikũ isarasu irhɛm umbi. <verse eid="2CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17"/>Umum ighamum urhambi ru ubok abirabɛ umum iki idene umbɔ aba ru umbi? <verse eid="2CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18"/>Umum ishɔ̃rhũ Utitu unga aba ru umbi ni idene ungwɛ̃mɛn nggu unga. Utitu aghaa urhambi? Umum nggu unga isi ikorhumɛn ubina unying nggu amɛn unying?<verse eid="2CO 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19"/>Umbi akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ umɛn ikũ uwurɛ ibee ika atsimɛn ru umbi? Umɛn iwu abika adɔsu Ukiristo ni irherhi idzidzɛrhe ra asu Unum. Umbi aze awɛrha, abinkɛ umɛn iki ikorhe kishoo, awu abinkɛ aki itsu umbi aker. <verse eid="2CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20"/>Umum igũ iwei ugɛ umum iba ĩbamum, iwuri ikpo umbi asi iwembi ru nyaka umum iki ibee umbi awe, ikɛi umbi awuri inyã umum isi iwemum ru nyaka umbi aka abee umum iwe. Umum igũ iwei ugɛ umum iba ĩbamum, umum iwuri iba ikakũ ifuw, nu unyɛ̃ɛ̃, nu avɔm, nu ibemitsi, nu ivɛrhe, nu iberi itsi, nu isisita. <verse eid="2CO 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21"/>Umum igũ iwei ugɛ umum ĩba ibvui ĩbamum ru umbi, Unum awuri idɛyiwanga umum arhimkɛ aka awe ru umbi nu ngge iwuri itsu umum igũ atsa ri itsimbi ni iciu akpe ra arhɛrhɛ abirabɛ aka agba ra arhim na asi idzipumbɔ ra abinkɛ umbɔ aka akorhe. Abin hã awu ida isisar, irha unerwi aka asi iwea utsɛ̃mbɔ use utsakmbɔ, use ikaifɛrhkɔ ri itsi ake, use ikorha abin ishĩ nu abin atsa amɛnmbɔ aka abee.<verse eid="2CO 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Itsũwã Uburhu iyiki imimasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1"/>Iyɛrɛ iwuri iwe iyiyepamum iyi untaar riyɛ ru umbi. Ru nyaku Itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubɛn arherhe awu ufang inera ivaa use itaar adzowe ideka ru arherhe ha.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Iva 17.6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19.15</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2"/>Umum iki itsɛrhumum umbi ri ivangyɛ umum iki iwe nggu umbi iyi ivaa. Umum icɛrɛ iki isi iwemum nggu umbi ibvui irherhumum, umum ĩba ibvui ĩbamum isi ínekukũ imesuwe amɛn ra abɔrɔ ha nu ubɛn unerwi aka awe ra arhim. <verse eid="2CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3"/>Akɛrɛ ha awuri idɛyiwa umbi ugɛ Ukiristo ani irherha arherhe ru ubokmum, ngge iki iwe ugɛ umbi abee ihwɛng. Unga asi imesuwanga umbi amɛn ri isheri iker, bɔr unga adɛyiwa nggaa ijeenga ru umbi. <verse eid="2CO 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4"/>Umbɔ anyapuwe unga ri isheri iker, bɔr unga abɛk ru ubok ijee Unum. Umɛn idɔ̃rhũmɛn igamɛn. Bɔr ru nyaku Ukiristo icɛrɛ aka abɛk ru ubok ijee Unum, umɛn ikɛi iwuri ĩbɛkmɛn ru ubok ijee Unum hã ru umbi.<verse eid="2CO 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5"/>Àka avira atsimbi ahwɛng use umbi awembi ri imangmang iyi idzidzɛrhe ru Ukiristo. Àka avira atsimbi. Umbi asi ihwɛngmbi ugɛ Ukiristo Uyesu awe ru umbi, umbi aba asi igbambi ivivira ha? <verse eid="2CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6"/>Umum ifosa ugɛ umbi awuri ihwɛngmbi ugɛ umɛn isi igbamɛn ivivira ha. <verse eid="2CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7"/>Umɛn ifɛn-Num ugɛ umbi niba akorhumbi ubinkpi uku uwe uvau. Asi iwea ugɛ umɛn ibee anera anyã ugɛɛ umɛn itɔ̃ itsermɛn izeizerhangge, bɔr ngge itsú umbi akorha abin aka aze, uko anera awuri inyã ugɛɛ umɛn iki ĩgbamɛn ri itsermɛn. <verse eid="2CO 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8"/>Umɛn isi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ ikorhumɛn ubinkpi uku ukɛn idzidzɛrhe, bɔr umɛn ikpurhi ikorhu ubinkpi uku itsu idzidzɛrhe igha inggbaashi. <verse eid="2CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9"/>Umɛn igũibɛn ivangyɛ umɛn iki ĩdɔ̃rhã bɔr umbi awe akeker. Ifɛn-Nummɛn iwe ugɛ umbi awe undzumunga. <verse eid="2CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10"/>Ngge itsu umum itsɛng akɛrɛ ha ivangyɛ umum iki ishimum umɔ, nggee ivangyɛ umum iki ĩba, umum ima ineke ikũ ijee iyiriyɛ Uteijee aka adzaa umum. Ijee ha iwu iyiki ifituwa umbi, isi iwengge iyiki ibupuwe umbi.<verse eid="2CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ighwe iyiki imimasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, ubinkpi umum iki ibee imashi ĩdɛyiwa umbi, àka agɔm anggɔm. Àka atsu amɛnmbi agbishu isiseimbi nggu adɔka. Àka afituwe adɔka. Àka awe amɛn unying. Àka asei uku ughwɔɔw. Umbi aba akorhumbi rimi, Unum uwuku ububema nu ididɔɔr awuri iwe nggu umbi. <verse eid="2CO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12"/>Àka aghwe adɔka nggu ighwe ibibema. <verse eid="2CO 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13"/>Kishoo abi Unum aghwe umbi. <verse eid="2CO 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14"/>Imimuta Uteijee Uyesu Ukiristo, nu ibibemu Unum, nu iwɛrhɛ Ipfu Isarsatangge ima iwe nggu umbi kishoo.<verse eid="2CO 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13"/>
</usx>
